ite, you expressly agree to be bound by all of the terms and conditions set forth in these documents. If you do not agree to these terms, you may not continue to use the Site and our services."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Revised version from : January 2025","italic":true}]}],"createdAt":"2024-12-19T14:56:53.413Z","updatedAt":"2025-02-03T15:19:53.198Z","questions":[{"id":27,"label":"Our cookies","richText":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to keep improving the quality of the services offered on our Site and to ensure that they meet your expectations, InnovArt uses ‘cookies’, text files used to identify your terminal when you connect to our Site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Our site uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to analyse traffic and understand how our visitors use our site. The following cookies are installed for this purpose:"}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"GA4 audience measurement cookie (_ga);"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"GA4 session cookie (ga[ID-SITE])."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"These cookies collect information such as:"}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of visits and unique visitors;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Time spent on the site;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Pages visited;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"The navigation path;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"The technical characteristics of your device;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Approximate geographical origin."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Cookie Name : _ga\nDomain : .innovart.com\nPurpose : Google Analytics\nType : Performance cookie\nDuration : 13 months  "}]}]},{"id":28,"label":"Cookie management","richText":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"We use a single audience analysis cookie (Google Analytics 4) to understand the use of our site and improve it. This cookie does not collect any personally identifiable data."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Our cookie management banner allows you to:"}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Accept the GA4 cookie;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Refuse the GA4 cookie;"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Modify your choice at any time via the “COOKIES” button at the bottom of the page."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Your choice is saved for 13 months. After this period, or if you delete your cookies, you will be asked for your consent again."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Refusal of the GA4 cookie in no way affects your browsing on our site."}]}]},{"id":29,"label":"Cookie management and browser settings","richText":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"The Help section of web browsers tells you how to refuse new cookies and how to obtain a notification message."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"To make things easier for you, here are links to the Help sections of the most commonly used browsers:"}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Safari: "},{"type":"link","url":"http://support.apple.com/kb/PH5042","children":[{"type":"text","text":"visit the website"}]},{"type":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Chrome: "},{"type":"link","url":"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=fr&hlrm=en","children":[{"type":"text","text